1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,678
Your bank holds Aziza's account, and she sells shoes online.

2
00:00:03,678 --> 00:00:08,785
But when her customers pay by card, the money goes to Payme and Click, not to you.

3
00:00:08,785 --> 00:00:12,916
With its own acquiring, your bank earns a commission on every payment.

4
00:00:12,916 --> 00:00:15,857
The rest stays in your bank too, as deposits.

5
00:00:15,857 --> 00:00:18,976
But running payments means facing fraudsters.

6
00:00:18,976 --> 00:00:22,011
Here are the four threats every bank fears.

7
00:00:22,011 --> 00:00:27,928
Next to Aziza's real shop, a site selling iPhones for fifty thousand soum looks just as real.

8
00:00:27,928 --> 00:00:33,500
Two bank employees check every shop, so only Aziza's real shop can take payments.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,892
A hacker copies Aziza's real payment and changes the amount to ten million.

10
00:00:37,892 --> 00:00:43,583
Every request is signed with Aziza's secret key, so the forged copy bounces off.

11
00:00:43,583 --> 00:00:49,404
A network glitch makes her shop send the same payment twice, and her customer could be charged twice.

12
00:00:49,404 --> 00:00:54,821
Your bank charges the customer only once, and Aziza keeps a happy customer.

13
00:00:54,821 --> 00:00:59,392
But what if hackers break into Aziza's shop to steal her customers' card numbers?

14
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:06,821
But cards are typed only on your bank's own page, and Aziza's shop keeps just a meaningless code, so there is nothing to steal.

15
00:01:06,821 --> 00:01:11,095
Every day, hundreds of payments like Aziza's land in your bank.

16
00:01:11,095 --> 00:01:17,059
Your bank keeps the commission, and each store gets the rest by the next banking day, in its account at your bank.

17
00:01:17,059 --> 00:01:22,273
A year later, merchants take card payments through your bank instead of Payme and Click.

18
00:01:22,273 --> 00:01:28,250
Aziza recommends you to other shop owners, and every new merchant brings your bank a commission and a deposit.

